  "decision_conditions": [
    "Design: The proposed two storey side and rear extension by virtue of its combined siting and alterations and additions to the existing roof, would create an incongruous overly dominant and visually bulky addition to the host property that would detract from the visual amenity, character and appearance of the host property and the surrounding area.\r\rAmenity: The proposal in relation to the neighbouring west facing kitchen window, would not be compliant with the BRE criteria for Vertical Sky Component or Annual Probable Sunlight Hours. As such, Having regard to the siting, scale, and design of the development, it is considered that the proposal would give rise to loss of outlook and material loss of day light at 20 Leyfield.\r\rTherefore, the proposed development is contrary to Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and Policies CS8, DM10 and DM12 of the Council's Core Strategy 2012"
  ],
